{"id":50339,"date":"2026-03-31T15:33:33","date_gmt":"2026-03-31T14:33:33","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=50339"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:53:45","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:53:45","slug":"maratona-de-barcelona","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-barcelona\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Barcelona 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de Barcelona 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Maratona de Barcelona 2027<\/strong> (oficialmente <em>Zurich Marat\u00f3 Barcelona<\/em>) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>14 de mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/strong>, com partida \u00e0s <strong>08:30<\/strong> (08:25 para atletas em cadeira de rodas), na capital da Catalunha, em <strong>Barcelona, Espanha<\/strong>. Homologada pela <strong>World Athletics<\/strong>, pela <strong>RFEA<\/strong> e pela Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Catal\u00e3 de Atletismo (FCA), a prova re\u00fane uma lota\u00e7\u00e3o at\u00e9 37.000 maratonistas num circuito 100% urbano, plano e monumental.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O tra\u00e7ado de <strong>42,195 km<\/strong> percorre as grandes avenidas do Eixample e os marcos arquitet\u00f3nicos do modernismo catal\u00e3o de Antoni Gaud\u00ed \u2014 como a <strong>Sagrada Fam\u00edlia<\/strong>, a <strong>Casa Batll\u00f3<\/strong> e <strong>La Pedrera (Casa Mil\u00e0)<\/strong> no <strong>Passeig de Gr\u00e0cia<\/strong> \u2014, estendendo-se at\u00e9 \u00e0 frente mar\u00edtima mediterr\u00e2nica, ao <strong>Parc de la Ciutadella<\/strong> e ao emblem\u00e1tico <strong>Arc de Triomf<\/strong>. Com 15 postos de abastecimento distribu\u00eddos a cada 2,5 km a partir do km 5, oferece condi\u00e7\u00f5es ideais para tentares um recorde pessoal na dist\u00e2ncia rainha.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Sob coordena\u00e7\u00e3o geral do <strong>Institut Barcelona Esports (Ajuntament de Barcelona)<\/strong> e organiza\u00e7\u00e3o executiva da <strong>RPM Sports<\/strong>, o evento disp\u00f5e de sistema de partidas por caixas de tempo (incluindo box Sub-Elite para marcas acreditadas), entrega de dorsais durante tr\u00eas dias na <strong>Expo Sports<\/strong> (quinta, sexta e s\u00e1bado) e tempo limite m\u00e1ximo de 6 horas. Consulta tamb\u00e9m o guia completo das principais <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Maratonas em Portugal<\/a> e planeia o teu ritmo na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">14 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Passeig de Gr\u00e0cia, Barcelona, Espanha<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 