rsais 1.001 a 6.000):<\/strong> 80,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (lote esgotar)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3 (Dorsais 6.001 a 16.000):<\/strong> 90,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (lote esgotar)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 4 (Dorsais 16.001 a 37.000):<\/strong> 100,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 07\/03\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Desporto Adaptado<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Maratona em Cadeira de Rodas (42,195 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 14 Mar \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:25<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e a que horas se realiza a Maratona de Barcelona 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A <strong>Zurich Marat\u00f3 Barcelona 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>14 de mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/strong>, em Barcelona (Espanha). A partida para a categoria de cadeira de rodas ocorre \u00e0s <strong>08:25<\/strong> e a partida geral da maratona (42,195 km) \u00e9 dada \u00e0s <strong>08:30<\/strong>, com tempo limite oficial de <strong>6h00<\/strong> ap\u00f3s a partida do \u00faltimo corredor (encerramento \u00e0s 16:00).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova disponibiliza um limite de <strong>37.000 dorsais<\/strong> (inscri\u00e7\u00f5es abertas at\u00e9 7 de mar\u00e7o de 2027 ou esgotar vagas) divididos em quatro escal\u00f5es: <strong>70,00 \u20ac<\/strong> do dorsal 1 ao 1.000; <strong>80,00 \u20ac<\/strong> do 1.001 ao 6.000; <strong>90,00 \u20ac<\/strong> do 6.001 ao 16.000; e <strong>100,00 \u20ac<\/strong> do dorsal 16.001 ao 37.000.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando \u00e9 efetuado o levantamento do dorsal e kit de atleta?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os dorsais, chips descart\u00e1veis (de coloca\u00e7\u00e3o obrigat\u00f3ria na sapatilha e devolu\u00e7\u00e3o na meta) e camisolas oficiais s\u00e3o entregues exclusivamente na feira do corredor (<strong>Expo Sports<\/strong>) na <strong>quinta-feira, sexta-feira e s\u00e1bado<\/strong> que antecedem a prova (11 a 13 de mar\u00e7o de 2027). N\u00e3o h\u00e1 entrega de dorsais no domingo da corrida.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funcionam os abastecimentos e as caixas de partida?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Existem postos de abastecimento l\u00edquido a cada 2,5 km desde o quil\u00f3metro 5 at\u00e9 ao quil\u00f3metro 40 (km 5, 7.5, 10, 12.5, 15, 17.5, 20, 22.5, 25, 27.5, 30, 32.5, 35, 37.5 e 40), al\u00e9m de abastecimento s\u00f3lido e l\u00edquido na meta. A partida \u00e9 estruturada por caixas de cor consoante o tempo estimado (modific\u00e1vel at\u00e9 1 de fevereiro de 2027).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza a Maratona de Barcelona e como funciona a mudan\u00e7a de titular?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A coordena\u00e7\u00e3o geral pertence ao <strong>Institut Barcelona Esports (Ajuntament de Barcelona)<\/strong> com organiza\u00e7\u00e3o executiva da <strong>RPM Sports<\/strong>. \u00c9 poss\u00edvel alterar o titular do dorsal at\u00e9 15 de fevereiro de 2027 na plataforma oficial (com taxa de gest\u00e3o de 15,00 \u20ac) ou acionar a garantia de reembolso (se subscrita no ato da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o) at\u00e9 22 de fevereiro de 2027.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Maratona de Barcelona 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-03-14\", \"endDate\": \"2027-03-14\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Barcelona, Espanha\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Espanha\", \"addressRegion\": \"Espanha\", \"addressCountry\": \"ES\"}}, \"description\": \"A Maratona de Barcelona 2027 (Zurich Marat\u00f3 Barcelona) realiza-se a 14 de mar\u00e7o \u00e0s 08:30 nos 42,195 km na Catalunha. Consulta o regulamento e inscreve-te j\u00e1!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-maratona-de-barcelona.webp\"], \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Zurich Marat\u00f3 Barcelona (42,195 km)\", \"price\": \"70.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.zurichmaratobarcelona.es\/en\/\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e a que horas se realiza a Maratona de Barcelona 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"AZurich Marat\u00f3 Barcelona 2027realiza-se no domingo,14 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, em Barcelona (Espanha). A partida para a categoria de cadeira de rodas ocorre \u00e0s08:25e a partida geral da maratona (42,195 km) \u00e9 dada \u00e0s08:30, com tempo limite oficial de6h00ap\u00f3s a partida do \u00faltimo corredor (encerramento \u00e0s 16:00).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o para 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova disponibiliza um limite de37.000 dorsais(inscri\u00e7\u00f5es abertas at\u00e9 7 de mar\u00e7o de 2027 ou esgotar vagas) divididos em quatro escal\u00f5es:70,00 \u20acdo dorsal 1 ao 1.000;80,00 \u20acdo 1.001 ao 6.000;90,00 \u20acdo 6.001 ao 16.000; e100,00 \u20acdo dorsal 16.001 ao 37.000.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando \u00e9 efetuado o levantamento do dorsal e kit de atleta?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os dorsais, chips descart\u00e1veis (de coloca\u00e7\u00e3o obrigat\u00f3ria na sapatilha e devolu\u00e7\u00e3o na meta) e camisolas oficiais s\u00e3o entregues exclusivamente na feira do corredor (Expo Sports) naquinta-feira, sexta-feira e s\u00e1badoque antecedem a prova (11 a 13 de mar\u00e7o de 2027). N\u00e3o h\u00e1 entrega de dorsais no domingo da corrida.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funcionam os abastecimentos e as caixas de partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Existem postos de abastecimento l\u00edquido a cada 2,5 km desde o quil\u00f3metro 5 at\u00e9 ao quil\u00f3metro 40 (km 5, 7.5, 10, 12.5, 15, 17.5, 20, 22.5, 25, 27.5, 30, 32.5, 35, 37.5 e 40), al\u00e9m de abastecimento s\u00f3lido e l\u00edquido na meta. A partida \u00e9 estruturada por caixas de cor consoante o tempo estimado (modific\u00e1vel at\u00e9 1 de fevereiro de 2027).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem organiza a Maratona de Barcelona e como funciona a mudan\u00e7a de titular?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A coordena\u00e7\u00e3o geral pertence aoInstitut Barcelona Esports (Ajuntament de Barcelona)com organiza\u00e7\u00e3o executiva daRPM Sports. \u00c9 poss\u00edvel alterar o titular do dorsal at\u00e9 15 de fevereiro de 2027 na plataforma oficial (com taxa de gest\u00e3o de 15,00 \u20ac) ou acionar a garantia de reembolso (se subscrita no ato da inscri\u00e7\u00e3o) at\u00e9 22 de fevereiro de 2027.\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70400,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,31],"event_type_2":[809,627],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-50339","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-barcelona-espanha","event_type-corrida","event_type-maratona","event_type_2-espanha","event_type_2-europa"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-maratona-de-barcelona.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50339","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=50339"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50339\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":71008,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50339\/revisions\/71008"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/70400"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalr